Getting Started

After installing DataOps Command Center, run the following as ACCOUNTADMIN:

text
GRANT IMPORTED PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE SNOWFLAKE TO APPLICATION DATAOPS_COMMAND_CENTER;
This grants read access to SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE views, which power all discovery and observability features.

Features

Executive Dashboard: KPIs, critical assets, reliability leaderboard, health distribution
Risk Analysis: Risk breakdown by owner role or database schema, with toggle
Cost Intelligence: Storage cost per table, zombie table detection, cost vs. reliability analysis
Asset Catalog: Searchable, filterable catalog of all tables and views in your account
Asset 360: Deep dive into any asset with reliability scores and dependency mapping
Lineage Explorer: Interactive dependency graph visualization
Impact Analysis: Recursive blast radius — see what breaks if an asset changes
Consumer Impact: Who queries what, orphan table detection, per-asset user breakdown
Anomaly Detection: Pattern-based freshness monitoring with deviation alerts
SLA Tracker: Automated compliance grading based on refresh cadence
AI Copilot: Cortex-powered root cause analysis with one-click diagnostics
Data Sources

The app reads only from built-in Snowflake system views:

SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.TABLES
SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.OBJECT_DEPENDENCIES
SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.ACCESS_HISTORY
SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.QUERY_HISTORY
SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.TABLE_STORAGE_METRICS
SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.WAREHOUSE_METERING_HISTORY
SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.TASK_HISTORY
SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.COLUMNS
No data leaves your account. No external connections are made.

Demo Mode

Enable Demo Mode in the sidebar to preview all features with synthetic data while your ACCOUNT_USAGE views populate (24-48 hours for new accounts).

Requirements

Role: ACCOUNTADMIN (for the GRANT command only)
Warehouse: Any active warehouse
Cortex AI: Available in most commercial Snowflake regions (powers the AI Copilot)
